Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uri! \NI need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to recruit Shiki Ichinose, \Nand I completely forgot a souvenir!
