Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A souvenir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that rude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Western sweets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Young people prefer western confectionery!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But savory things are also good—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Muffled noises*{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... \NDon't you have something else to say before souvenirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm!! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Daisho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to go see Shiki Ichinose \Nall by yourself, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know where Rasetsu Academy is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not on any map, and nobody will tell you if you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you somehow knew, an extreme sense-of-direction \Nidiot like you could never get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I have no choice but to tag along with you like this. \NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My slam— *{\i1}Muffled*{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't speak with your mouth closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you tend to rush ahead, \Nso I'm saying you should consult with me as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because chasing after you when you suddenly bolt is seriously exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm-mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, are you carsick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Puff-puff-puff!*{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait 5 more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get there soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare throw up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Puff-puff-puff!*{\i0}
